    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d608-a2">

                <pb facs="1070" n="976" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg976"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 to inclosure in No.
                    141.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to the
                            civil governor of Cuba.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-10-29"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 29,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to inform your
                    excellency that by the steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Niagara</hi>, which
                    arrived from New York on the 28th instant, Messrs. Anthony P. Hamilton and
                    Christopher Ahrens, citizens of the United States, came passengers en route to
                    Mexico.</p>
                <pb facs="1071" n="977" xml:id="pg977"/>
                <p>But upon endeavoring to take passage at this port in the Spanish steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Reina Mercedes</hi>, which leaves for Vera Cruz on the
                    31st instant, the consignees of said steamer exacted passports of them from the
                    civil government.</p>
                <p>I have, therefore, respectfully to request that you will be pleased to issue
                    passports to these gentlemen in order to avoid the interruption of their
                    voyage.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ramon O. Williams</hi>.<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul-General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
